SUMMARY:Opening Reception: The Shape of Repair: Patchwork in Wood Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Meet artist Laura Petrovich-Cheney and celebrate the opening of her The Shape of Repair: Patchwork in Wood exhibition in the S. Tucker Cooke Gallery. Known for quilt-inspired wall sculptures made from salvaged architectural wood\, Petrovich-Cheney explores memory\, repair\, and renewal through geometric compositions that bring together the traditions of quilting and contemporary sculpture. The reception will take place alongside an artist talk. The event is free and open to the public. \nUnable to attend the reception? The exhibition will be on view August 20 through September 11. Click here to learn more. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Accessibility\nUNC Asheville is committed to providing universal access to all of our events. If you have any questions about access or would like to request reasonable accommodations that will facilitate your full participation in the film screenings\, please contact Stephanie Bullick\, Director of Accessibility\, at accessibility@unca.edu.
URL:https://www.unca.edu/event/opening-reception-the-shape-of-repair-patchwork-in-wood-exhibition/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.unca.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Event-Calendar-Grapic-The-Shape-of-Repair-V2-1.png
END:VEVENT
